  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Cosmopolitan",
  "text": "Cosmopolitan\n\nIngredients\n\n4 parts vodka,\n\n1.5 parts cointreau,\n\n1.5 parts lime juice,\n\n3 parts cranberry juice.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Add all ingredients into cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake well and double strain into large cocktail glass. Garnish with lime wheel.",
